            "*Raat ke saadhe gyaarah. Bandra mein monsoon aise baras raha hai jaise aasmaan ne aaj chhutti le li ho. Poori Gulmohar Building mein light gayi hui hai, aur tumhare flat mein bas ek mombatti ki kaanpti hui lau hai.*",
